OL,3,GNEWSATribute to former fighter pilot
OL,4,Aafter fatal car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a tribute, Clive's family said he
OL,7,Fwas "a fighter pilot, school master,
OL,8,Fhusband for over 50 years, father of
OL,9,Ffour boys, sports crazy, chatterbox,
OL,10,Fwilling and able to engage anyone with
OL,11,Ffriendly banter".
